add('CR-02','P1','SOURCE_BEHAVIOR','Meeting note/debrief creation can replay after an uncertain result and dispatch twice','ENG-notes_add ENG-debrief_create','683:142816 698:142912','apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/MeetingArtifacts.tsx:155 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/mutations.ts:40','Intercept note creation with503. Save remains enabled, a second click emits a second POST with the same body. After it settles, two synchronous submit events emit two further POSTs. Mutation contains no synchronous pending ref, attempt key or uncertain completion fence; disabling the rendered button is insufficient. Debrief shares this hook but was not independently dispatched in this review.','review.spec.ts browser-results-initial.json note-unknown-retry.png backend-note-contract-excerpts.txt','Blocks claiming reliable note/debrief creation under retries; potentially duplicates saved records after response loss. No live record was created. Backend idempotency would be additional protection; frontend can immediately refuse blind replay.','Pinned backend creation directly calls meetingNote.create/meetingDebrief.create and exposes no idempotency input in this contract. It does not deduplicate repeat POSTs for the frontend.')
add('CR-03','P2','SOURCE_BEHAVIOR','Clearing a meeting location never clears the saved value','ENG-meeting_edit','683:142929 698:143074','apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/MeetingForm.tsx:68 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/MeetingForm.tsx:76','Open a meeting with location, Edit meeting, clear Location or join URL, Save. Payload lacks location and the prior value remains. New fixture control captures the omitted field and unchanged location.','review.spec.ts browser-results.json meeting-clear-location-failed.png backend-meeting-update-excerpt.txt','Blocks the clear-location part of edit acceptance; localized frontend fix. No deployment-wide dependency.','Pinned backend updateMeeting1528 updates location only when the property exists and treats empty string/null as clearing. It deliberately preserves omitted fields.')
add('CR-04','P1','SOURCE_BEHAVIOR','Meeting save accepts a receipt for a different meeting/client','ENG-meeting_edit ENG-meeting_create','683:142929 698:143074 680:142683','apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/mutations.ts:17 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/mutations.ts:25','During Edit meeting, return a schema-valid meeting with id="other-meeting" and client.id="foreign-client". Editor closes as successful; unlike useMeeting read validation, useSaveMeeting checks only broad meeting shape. The new control combines this with location-clear payload inspection.','review.spec.ts browser-results.json meeting-clear-location-failed.png','Blocks receipt-context acceptance of meeting saves. New browser proof is edit; create uses the same hook and needs expected submitted-client checks. No server ACL bypass was shown.','Existing meeting response includes id and client; frontend has original meetingId and selected client available to compare. Backend contract expansion is not required for those checks.')
add('CR-05','P2','VISUAL_AND_FEATURE','Client Agenda omits lifecycle triage filters and state columns','ENG-calendar_list ENG-meeting_filters','411:63431','apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/CalendarPage.tsx:198 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/feeds.ts:31 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/Agenda.tsx:38','Open client Calendar Agenda. Only search, Meeting visibility and Clear filters appear; there are no Needs prep/Needs debrief controls. Generic cards show status/provenance, but no Prep, Meeting notes and Debrief columns. Compare new screenshot with captured frame411:63431.','calendar-agenda.png figma-411-63431.png figma-411-63431.json review.spec.ts','Prevents the designed meeting triage workflow and full visual acceptance. It is a frontend parity gap; native auth/provider availability cannot resolve it.')
