add('CR-08','P2','MISSING_FRONTEND_FACET','Prep and attachment share/unshare are missing','ENG-meeting_share_artifacts ENG-meeting_unshare_artifacts','682:142827 698:142722 683:142902 698:142952','apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/mutations.ts:67 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/preparation/MeetingPreparation.tsx:330 apps/web/src/features/portfolio/calendar/review/MeetingAttachmentApprovals.tsx:34','Inspect meeting preparation and attachment controls. Prep can be read/refined/exported/emailed; attachment can be reviewed/approved. Only note/debrief artifact changes build share/unshare requests. No prep/attachment branch or selection exists in Portfolio Calendar.','backend-artifact-shared-contract-excerpt.txt','Two rows are partially implemented, not wholly unavailable: note/debrief operations exist, prep/attachment facets do not. These missing controls block full artifact sharing acceptance; feature flag/provider-native acceptance remains separate.','Pinned controller2089/2098 exposes per-artifact share/unshare. Existing contract has target artifact list; no need to invent whole-meeting sharing, which remains excluded.')
